# Go Style

- Keep packages small; business logic lives in `internal/fs`, thin entry in `cmd/msfs`.
- Return sentinel errors with `errors.New` / `fmt.Errorf` and wrap with `%w` for context.
- Do not panic in normal control flow; return errors.
- Map PDF operations to clear method names: `Pwd`, `Cd`, `Mkdir`, `List`, `Rmdir`, `CreateFile`, `WriteFile`, `ReadFile`, `MoveFile`, `Find`.
- Comment only non-obvious rules: directory merge on copy/move, hardlink inode sharing, list insertion order, collision suffix `~N`.
